# This file contains static DHCP host mappings. Each line defines a predictable
# identity for a known client.

# These are example definitions and shouldn't reflect your actual environment.
#52:54:00:12:34:56,server1,192.168.1.10
#52:54:00:65:43:21,printer1,192.168.1.20

# Static host mappings are evaluated before dynamic allocation and do not
# consume addresses from the DHCP range.
